					<![CDATA[
						 <p><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/duccy-boi" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7059423&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606976162" alt="Duccy boi" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7059423)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/duccy-boi" >Duccy boi</a></span>, instead of posting multiple comments in succession, please edit your previous post using the &quot;edit&quot; function under the &quot;options&quot; tab to the lower right of every comment. That prevents spam buildup, and it's in the rules.</p> <p>Also, please note that your entry contained numerous basic errors, most noticeably only capitalizing the name of your own character. Ideally, get your intended material looked at before adding it to the page, so you can address errors before the page is pruned.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
